    {
      "text": "Lord had respect unto Abel, Gen. 4:4 (Moses 5:20). children of Israel … God had respect unto them, Ex. 2:25. shalt not respect the person of the poor, Lev. 19:15. Ye shall not respect persons in judgment, Deut. 1:17. have thou respect unto the prayer, 1 Kgs. 8:28 (2 Chr. 6:19). respect unto them, because of his covenant, 2 Kgs. 13:23. he respecteth not any that are wise of heart, Job 37:24. Blessed is that man that … respecteth not the proud, Ps. 40:4. Have respect unto the covenant, Ps. 74:20. Lord … hath he respect unto the lowly, Ps. 138:6. not good to have respect of persons in judgment, Prov. 24:23 (28:21). his eyes shall have respect to the Holy One, Isa. 17:7.",
